<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi bourse plans trading during budget session.</title>
<headline>Karachi bourse plans trading during budget session.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Karachi Stock Exchange (KSE) plans a special trading session to coincide with presentation of the 1997/98 (July-June) budget in parliament on Friday, a KSE spokesman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The session would start when Finance Minister Sartaj Aziz makes his budget speech, due to begin at 5.30 p.m. (1230 GMT), and end one hour after the speech, the spokesman said.</p>
<p>-- Karachi Newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
